      "text": "Groebner-Shirshov basis and reduced words for affine Weyl group A_n — Using Buchberger-Shirshov Algorithm and Composition-Diamond lemma we obtain the reduced Gr¨obner-Shirshov bases of f An and\n\n**Groebner-Shirshov basis and reduced words for affine Weyl group A_n**\n\n*GRÖBNER-SHIRSHOV BASIS AND REDUCED WORDS FOR*\n\n11 pp, 5 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** Using Buchberger-Shirshov Algorithm and Composition-Diamond lemma we obtain the reduced Gr¨obner-Shirshov bases of f An and classify all reduced words of the aﬃne Weyl group f An.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Gröbner-Shirshov Basis and Reduced Words; 3 Counting Reduced Words; References",
